<title>CUBA: TENNIS-CUBA, PERU LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CUBA, PERU LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>HAVANA 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cuba and Peru were level 1-1</p>
<p>after Friday's opening singles matches in their Davis Cup</p>
<p>Americas zone group two first round tie.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Lazaro Navarro (Cuba) beat Alejandro Aramburu 6-1 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Americo Venero (Peru) beat Juan Antonio Pino (Cuba) 6-4</p>
<p>7-5 5-7 6-3</p>
</text>
